  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Integrated Community Resilience Initiative (SIRI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sudan Integrated Community Resilience Initiative (SIRI) is UNDP Sudan&#x2019;s flagship on community resilience under the Resilience and Recovery Pillar. The Resilience and Recovery Pillar within the UNDP Sudan aspires to build the adaptative capacities of crises-affected communities to prevent, manage and recovery efficiently from disasters and to thrive. Our programming adopts the principles of Area-based integrated programming that enable the people of Sudan identify threats and anticipate risk</narrative>
  </description>
